11
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,622
This module covers 5 topics.

12
00:00:45,622 --> 00:00:50,969
Genomes as data — A genome is the full DNA information set of an organism or sample.

13
00:00:50,969 --> 00:00:56,125
PCR and amplification — PCR amplifies chosen DNA regions so they can be analyzed.

14
00:00:56,125 --> 00:01:01,409
Gel electrophoresis and comparison — Gel electrophoresis separates DNA fragments by

15
00:01:01,409 --> 00:01:02,609
size.

16
00:01:02,609 --> 00:01:07,702
Genetic engineering tools — Biotechnology tools can copy, edit, compare, or move

17
00:01:07,702 --> 00:01:08,975
genetic information.

18
00:01:08,975 --> 00:01:14,259
Biotechnology decisions and ethics — Applications require evidence, risk reasoning,

19
00:01:14,259 --> 00:01:15,596
and ethical judgment.

20
00:01:15,596 --> 00:01:19,234
Each topic builds on the one before it, forming a coherent explanation.

21
00:01:19,984 --> 00:01:22,246
